WEBVTT

00:18.000 --> 00:19.830
All units, insert stylets.

00:23.040 --> 00:26.510
Commencing the 27th attempt of a physical connection to BUER.

00:26.510 --> 00:27.840
Deploying attack barriers.

00:27.840 --> 00:29.880
Assume maximum load.

00:29.880 --> 00:31.010
Colonel Kurtz.

00:31.390 --> 00:32.390
Connect.

00:33.510 --> 00:34.510
Connecting!

00:37.270 --> 00:39.100
Unit 5, signal lost!

00:39.100 --> 00:41.350
Unit 3, unit 6, lost!

00:41.940 --> 00:43.940
A network outage is occurring on the surface!

00:45.360 --> 00:47.610
Right on schedule again, it would seem.

00:47.610 --> 00:49.280
Never mind that, continue.

00:49.740 --> 00:51.820
Unit 4, maintaining connection!

00:52.820 --> 00:54.700
Injecting micromachines!

00:56.240 --> 01:00.710
We've infiltrated the maze of barriers that we believe
to be the outer layer of BUER's main systems!

01:01.040 --> 01:03.380
Maintaining that circuit is our highest priority.

01:03.380 --> 01:05.550
Commencing penetration of the next barrier.

01:05.550 --> 01:06.630
We're winning, marginally.

01:06.630 --> 01:07.710
We can keep going!

01:08.090 --> 01:10.430
As we should.

01:10.430 --> 01:12.340
Now give me results, as scheduled.

01:12.340 --> 01:13.340
Yes, sir.

01:13.340 --> 01:17.140
<i>That genius, Sahar Schehera, left behind BUER.</i>

01:17.140 --> 01:19.180
<i>What is its eye looking towards?</i>

01:20.560 --> 01:22.480
Detecting an intense heat source within BUER!

02:56.780 --> 02:58.490
Observing a shift in magnetic field!

02:58.490 --> 03:00.200
Temperature rising!

03:02.540 --> 03:03.960
<i>This is...</i>

03:05.040 --> 03:06.250
It can't be...

03:07.040 --> 03:08.750
It's watching us?

03:09.630 --> 03:12.090
Move the classified storage out immediately!

03:12.090 --> 03:13.460
I don't care if it's processing!

03:13.920 --> 03:16.220
There's a risk of data loss!

03:16.220 --> 03:18.340
When will we get another chance like this!?

03:18.760 --> 03:19.600
Do it.

03:28.400 --> 03:32.820
<i>Infiltrating its first layer of barriers heightened its security systems.</i>

03:35.950 --> 03:36.820
What the hell!?

03:52.090 --> 03:54.920
We'll make certain the CDF doesn't find out about this.

03:54.920 --> 03:55.550
Yes, sir.

03:56.970 --> 03:59.840
At least I got to observe BUER's power.

04:00.470 --> 04:02.560
This much destruction with minimal numbers.

04:03.390 --> 04:04.680
There's no arguing it:

04:04.680 --> 04:07.310
Sahar Schehera was a pure genius.

04:08.350 --> 04:13.270
And the best genius is a dead one.

04:13.270 --> 04:16.360
I'll put this legacy to good use.

04:17.490 --> 04:21.700
We are the second hand that ticks away the order of the world.

04:21.700 --> 04:24.490
All for the promised world peace.

04:28.120 --> 04:30.250
All right, hold your breath.

04:30.540 --> 04:32.460
B-B-B-B-B-B-B-B-By all means!

04:37.010 --> 04:38.260
I'll take that.

04:40.430 --> 04:43.180
Okay, there's no clumping or anything.

04:45.100 --> 04:47.180
Oh, you can speak now.

04:52.190 --> 04:53.440
Clarin!

04:55.530 --> 04:56.940
Together with Clarin.

04:56.940 --> 05:00.570
I was told you're only here for a partial hair implant, Clarion.

05:00.570 --> 05:03.030
And that I should let you tune your mechanicals yourself.

05:03.030 --> 05:03.950
I will.

05:04.450 --> 05:05.740
Configuration complete.

05:05.740 --> 05:09.960
That's incredible. Your tweakings are very thorough.

05:12.290 --> 05:14.250
Under no circumstances may you look.

05:14.250 --> 05:15.040
Of course.

05:16.210 --> 05:17.420
You mustn't look.

05:17.420 --> 05:18.710
Yes, yes.

05:19.170 --> 05:20.720
Well then, Nene.

05:20.720 --> 05:23.260
All that's left for you is your epidermal coating.

05:23.260 --> 05:23.970
Yes, sir!

05:28.810 --> 05:30.100
That's amazing, Clarin!

05:30.100 --> 05:31.850
You're all sparkly!

05:31.850 --> 05:33.060
That'll do.

05:33.060 --> 05:34.480
You can get changed now.

05:35.060 --> 05:37.230
And here's your petroid doll back.

05:37.780 --> 05:40.400
I am no pet, ministering angel!

05:40.400 --> 05:42.950
I am the demon king BU—

05:43.490 --> 05:44.990
Much obliged.

05:45.620 --> 05:50.540
Since a lot of new parts were retrofit
please speak up if anything feels off.

05:50.540 --> 05:51.370
Yes, sir!

05:51.370 --> 05:53.250
And thanks for helping Clarin too.

05:53.250 --> 05:56.630
Oh, no problem. It was all explained to me.

05:56.630 --> 05:59.550
<i>Do as you think is best and don't ask questions.</i>

06:00.260 --> 06:03.380
Be more careful. Take care of yourself.

06:03.380 --> 06:04.260
Yes, sir.

06:04.260 --> 06:08.720
To end up at the scene of the
fire though... how unfortunate.

06:08.720 --> 06:11.060
I hear they still don't know what caused it.

06:11.060 --> 06:13.140
There's rumors of arson.

06:13.140 --> 06:16.770
So many bad things have been
happening lately, so take care.

06:16.770 --> 06:17.820
Yes, ma'am!

06:17.820 --> 06:20.280
Well, that's all for today.

06:20.280 --> 06:21.860
Please take it easy, you two.

06:21.860 --> 06:23.570
We appreciate all your help.

06:26.410 --> 06:31.750
We were told not to be concerned about this,
but I do wonder who exactly Clarion is.

06:31.750 --> 06:33.540
Who can say?

06:33.540 --> 06:36.750
She's adorable though.
Maybe that's all that matters.

06:36.750 --> 06:38.130
Indeed.

06:44.340 --> 06:45.970
It's so pretty.

06:57.810 --> 06:59.020
Okay!

06:59.020 --> 06:59.980
Hey, Clarin.

06:59.980 --> 07:01.690
Want to go shopping tomorrow?

07:01.690 --> 07:04.570
We can find something <i>you</i> want.

07:04.570 --> 07:08.120
You wanted... equipment and reserves, right?

07:08.530 --> 07:10.200
I no longer need those.

07:10.200 --> 07:11.370
Oh, okay.

07:11.660 --> 07:13.830
Then let's go buy some clothes!

07:14.660 --> 07:18.920
You know, I want you to find something you want, too.

07:19.420 --> 07:22.130
Something akin to your world peace?

07:22.130 --> 07:22.920
Yeah.

07:22.920 --> 07:26.590
You're always helping me, after all.

07:26.590 --> 07:30.390
So I wanna help you achieve what you want, too.

07:30.390 --> 07:32.680
Understood. I'll think about it.

07:33.060 --> 07:34.310
Promise?

07:34.930 --> 07:36.100
I promise.

07:42.730 --> 07:44.440
And done!

07:44.900 --> 07:48.820
With all the repairs and checkups,
a bunch of schoolwork had piled up.

07:51.030 --> 07:53.700
Clarin, I'm glad your ears got fixed up.

07:53.700 --> 07:54.910
How are they?

07:54.910 --> 07:58.290
Satisfactory. Complete. Ideal. Pleasant.

07:58.290 --> 08:00.960
They got singed, so I was worried.

08:01.250 --> 08:03.210
You were so gallant.

08:03.210 --> 08:07.300
You were like a cat prince.

08:07.300 --> 08:08.720
Cat prince?

08:13.560 --> 08:14.890
She's shutdown?

08:14.890 --> 08:16.310
Clarin...

08:17.770 --> 08:23.770
I've never been so happy or
had this much fun before.

08:23.770 --> 08:26.990
So... I hope these days...

08:27.400 --> 08:29.860
last forever...

08:33.990 --> 08:36.580
And now, for the angel's <i></i>kiss!

08:36.580 --> 08:37.660
Mouth to mouth!

08:48.840 --> 08:50.010
Huh?

08:59.350 --> 09:01.150
Great...

09:01.150 --> 09:05.020
The terrorism and network outages
are destabilizing our currency.

09:05.360 --> 09:10.070
Not only that, but the American Imperial Army's advisory group has been nagging us on every issue.

09:10.070 --> 09:12.910
Bet I know what they're after.

09:15.410 --> 09:17.790
I figured you'd come sooner or later.

09:18.620 --> 09:20.290
Uzal's puppet.

09:22.630 --> 09:24.500
Is this about BUER?

09:27.300 --> 09:30.510
I somehow managed to survive that chaos caused by the fire,

09:30.510 --> 09:32.090
but things got weird!

09:32.090 --> 09:34.430
This isn't the idol I wanted to be!

09:34.430 --> 09:37.770
I thought I'd hide out for a while in the refugee camp...

09:38.100 --> 09:40.520
but as it turns out, it's no longer there!

09:40.520 --> 09:43.940
Is my intel outdated!?

09:44.520 --> 09:45.900
That's impos—

09:53.160 --> 09:54.530
R-Run!

09:56.450 --> 09:57.910
<i>It's a scoop!</i>

09:59.450 --> 10:00.290
That's right!

10:00.290 --> 10:02.500
What did I come to this island for!?

10:02.500 --> 10:03.460
Don't lose yourself!

10:03.790 --> 10:05.460
Now, to gather my team!

10:05.460 --> 10:08.300
You have reached a voice mailbox.

10:08.750 --> 10:11.260
The battlefield that is journalism is oh-so solitary!

10:11.260 --> 10:12.340
I shall conquer it alone!

10:12.340 --> 10:15.220
I'm the journalism breakthrough, the super idol, Vli—

10:21.560 --> 10:25.350
Where the heck has she gone?

10:26.730 --> 10:30.070
Oh, looks like she called a minute ago.

10:31.860 --> 10:33.320
It's a scheduled delivery.

10:34.360 --> 10:35.990
Hey, are you listening?

10:36.320 --> 10:37.490
It's the usual deal, right?

10:37.490 --> 10:39.160
Probably just more work machines.

10:57.430 --> 10:59.430
Intruder alert! Intruder alert!

10:59.430 --> 11:02.060
Incursion by an unidentified hostile force!

11:13.650 --> 11:15.950
All troops, level one battle stations!

11:16.410 --> 11:18.450
Details about hostile force unknown!

11:21.870 --> 11:27.500
All units, enable head-cams and engage!

11:29.170 --> 11:31.090
Intercept! Intercept!

11:31.420 --> 11:35.380
Orders have been issued for the unconditional
extermination of any trespassers within the facility!

11:37.930 --> 11:41.100
The enemy force consists of a large mobile
weapon and multiple automated infantry!

11:41.510 --> 11:42.600
Types unknown!

11:42.600 --> 11:45.270
Our equipment isn't fit to counter them!

11:46.940 --> 11:49.100
Gas masks on!

11:49.730 --> 11:51.650
What's going on?

11:51.650 --> 11:53.610
Put me through to the colonel.

11:54.070 --> 11:54.990
Warning!

11:54.990 --> 11:58.110
There's a possibility this facility's system is being hacked!

12:00.370 --> 12:04.040
They're moving from S14E to N14F!

12:04.040 --> 12:06.370
All units: weapons free!

12:12.210 --> 12:13.880
Good! We can take 'em!

12:13.880 --> 12:15.380
Halt their advance!

12:16.920 --> 12:17.550
What's that!?

12:21.180 --> 12:22.260
Disengage!

12:22.260 --> 12:24.390
All troops, fall back to Shaft 2!

12:24.390 --> 12:25.890
We're closing the barrier!

12:34.270 --> 12:36.490
What <i>are</i> those things!?

12:36.490 --> 12:39.070
I... saw her...

12:39.070 --> 12:40.780
On top of the enemy's mobile weapon...

12:41.240 --> 12:44.580
A little girl with cat ears...

12:44.580 --> 12:46.540
wearing a maid outfit!

12:46.540 --> 12:48.160
What a stupid joke.

12:48.160 --> 12:50.040
N-No! You gotta believe me!

12:53.040 --> 12:56.210
Shinokaomi, Code Yatsukahagi.

12:56.210 --> 12:58.050
Code authentication, clear.

12:58.050 --> 12:59.630
Yatsukahagi Mode.

12:59.630 --> 13:01.340
Foot gears, crampons locked.

13:02.390 --> 13:03.890
Moving main deck.

13:03.890 --> 13:05.060
Releasing barrel.

13:11.690 --> 13:13.560
All energy lines directly connected.

13:14.230 --> 13:16.570
Chamber interior pressurizing normally.

13:16.570 --> 13:18.650
Commencing rifling rotation.

13:24.530 --> 13:25.530
Ready to fire.

13:29.500 --> 13:31.120
Get some counseling, man.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.460
It's the truth!

13:32.460 --> 13:33.670
Fine, fine.

13:33.670 --> 13:35.500
I bet it's some new Alliance wea—

13:50.930 --> 13:54.560
Cat ears... maid outfit...

13:54.940 --> 13:58.070
What a stupid joke.

14:02.860 --> 14:04.570
Is this about BUER?

14:05.570 --> 14:07.240
I request your cooperation.

14:07.240 --> 14:09.540
Cooperation?

14:09.540 --> 14:14.080
Why should I have to
cooperate with the likes of you?

14:17.290 --> 14:18.630
A video?

14:20.380 --> 14:22.970
I'll be up front with you.

14:23.380 --> 14:24.970
This is a warning.

14:24.970 --> 14:26.720
U-Uzal!?

14:26.720 --> 14:28.970
My name is Uzal Delilah.

14:28.970 --> 14:32.270
I'm a great genius, and a beautiful, wise scientist.

14:32.270 --> 14:33.480
It's a huge headache!

14:33.770 --> 14:38.150
I ordered that this video be shown to
someone who meets a certain requirement,

14:38.150 --> 14:42.190
once it's been confirmed that BUER
is at risk of going on a rampage.

14:42.190 --> 14:44.320
Certain requirement?

14:44.320 --> 14:45.740
Let's start from the conclusion.

14:45.740 --> 14:50.240
If BUER, my creation, is started in a way that deviates from proper procedure,

14:50.910 --> 14:52.750
it <i>will</i> go berserk. No exceptions.

14:53.330 --> 14:57.000
Attempting to hack its system or
physically damage it will yield the same.

14:57.580 --> 15:00.840
If pushed too far, it will most likely
keep rampaging until it self-destructs.

15:01.960 --> 15:05.760
I don't intend to hand BUER over to anyone.

15:05.760 --> 15:08.010
I repeat, this is a warning.

15:08.390 --> 15:11.430
The fact that someone is watching this video

15:11.430 --> 15:15.020
means a crisis is about to unfold on Cenancle Island.

15:15.520 --> 15:18.520
Someone is trying to move in on BUER.

15:19.820 --> 15:24.360
You're free to do whatever you
want once you hear this warning.

15:24.360 --> 15:31.200
But personally, I sincerely hope you'll choose to contribute to the peace of this island.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.740
Yours sincerely.

15:34.830 --> 15:37.750
Things are as screwed up as ever.

15:37.750 --> 15:42.590
I knew the American Imperial Army was
swarming like ants through Uzal's henhouse.

15:42.590 --> 15:47.130
But I ignored them, since I thought
they'd never succeed in interfering.

15:47.760 --> 15:49.140
What's this?

15:49.800 --> 15:52.260
An image from just after the Herme's fire broke out.

15:53.060 --> 15:57.770
Evidence that a particle cannon beam passed through the foundation of Herme's from underground.

15:59.060 --> 16:01.150
BUER has started to go berserk?

16:01.940 --> 16:04.650
Does that mean history is going to repeat itself?

16:05.030 --> 16:08.360
What are you expecting out of our cooperation?

16:08.360 --> 16:10.530
I request equipment and reserves.

16:10.530 --> 16:14.040
You want to start a fight with
the American Imperial Army?

16:14.040 --> 16:15.540
Sounds like trouble.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.920
Combat is not the objective.

16:17.920 --> 16:20.290
I will reach BUER as quickly as possible

16:20.290 --> 16:22.540
and take measures to stabilize it.

16:23.210 --> 16:24.920
Stabilizing BUER.

16:24.920 --> 16:28.050
Is following that order your objective?

16:28.050 --> 16:29.130
No.

16:30.180 --> 16:32.050
Nanakorobi Nene's safety is.

16:43.940 --> 16:45.440
You passed!

16:47.360 --> 16:48.820
Take this with you.

16:49.240 --> 16:54.330
It's unstable, so I gave up on commercializing it,
but <i>you</i> could probably find a way to make it work.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.330
I'll cooperate with you.

16:57.080 --> 16:59.790
But there's one condition!

17:06.050 --> 17:08.090
No murder.

17:08.090 --> 17:12.840
I know more or less what Uzal was
after when she made you.

17:12.840 --> 17:15.100
This condition applies to more than just this situation.

17:15.720 --> 17:20.600
The condition is that you won't
robotically kill or abandon anyone.

17:21.310 --> 17:23.360
The moment you violate this rule...

17:24.520 --> 17:29.860
you lose your one and only right to be by Nene's side.

17:47.340 --> 17:52.010
Gods of purification...

17:52.010 --> 17:56.140
I humbly, humbly request that you ask of all the deities

17:56.140 --> 18:12.400
for their help in purifying and
cleansing all evil and impurities...

18:21.290 --> 18:25.790
I said I'd cooperate, but I never said I'd heed the warning.

18:28.420 --> 18:30.340
BUER belongs to me.

18:30.760 --> 18:32.590
I won't let anyone else have it.

18:37.800 --> 18:41.810
I followed a suspicious figure because I smelled a scoop,

18:41.810 --> 18:45.690
and now here I am in some mysterious
sprawling underground facility beneath the park!

18:49.070 --> 18:52.570
I'm ordinary great idol reporter, Vli—

18:58.580 --> 19:00.830
Zero soldiers dead or heavily wounded.

19:01.200 --> 19:04.830
She's handling Shinokaomi
masterfully, I'll give her that.

19:05.170 --> 19:07.710
This block is fully under our control.

19:07.710 --> 19:10.380
That should take care of most of the enemies.

19:11.250 --> 19:14.340
I did it, boss. Issa scoop.

19:14.930 --> 19:20.600
We'll let the Gercomas clean up here,
and continue on with the elite exterminators.

19:20.600 --> 19:21.680
Understood.

19:30.860 --> 19:32.360
I've been waiting, Clarion!

19:33.320 --> 19:35.860
I'll show you to your grave.

19:38.660 --> 19:40.580
Uh, do you recognize me?

19:40.950 --> 19:43.080
It's me, Bunny!

19:43.700 --> 19:45.080
Don't ignore me!

19:45.540 --> 19:48.830
Look at these combat robots I built!

19:49.210 --> 19:52.250
I didn't oversee Sahar's base for nothing, you know!

19:53.050 --> 19:57.760
With the drop of my hand,
they'll simultaneously lay waste to yo—

20:03.390 --> 20:05.770
Hey! Stop! Stop!

20:08.270 --> 20:10.150
I said stop, damn it!

20:11.310 --> 20:13.570
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

20:16.110 --> 20:18.860
Why does this always happen to me...

20:19.610 --> 20:22.370
I only meant to threaten her and capture her...

20:25.330 --> 20:26.620
N-Not even a scratch!?

20:27.290 --> 20:28.370
Talk about <i>armor</i>!

20:30.080 --> 20:30.750
No...

20:34.460 --> 20:36.800
An anti-optical weapon smoke screen!

20:36.800 --> 20:39.010
She's damping the lasers with the smoke!

20:39.010 --> 20:39.890
You cheeky bitch.

20:53.770 --> 20:56.150
The hell was all that about?

20:56.860 --> 21:01.160
Once we're past this block, we'll reach where BUER's been isolated, right?

21:01.160 --> 21:02.910
Uzal's BUER—

21:04.200 --> 21:06.790
Wh-What's going on!?

21:47.410 --> 21:49.450
You dodged that attack?

21:50.040 --> 21:52.540
It seems it wasn't the multi-legged tank's abilities

21:52.540 --> 21:54.920
that overpowered an entire unit of the Imperial Army.

21:55.710 --> 21:58.920
And you seem too refined to be Alliance or Holy Republic.

21:59.510 --> 22:00.420
I like you.

22:02.760 --> 22:04.970
I'll keep you company for five minutes only.

22:10.520 --> 22:12.940
Good morning, Clarin.

22:19.230 --> 22:20.280
Clarin?

22:40.960 --> 22:43.970
Accessing the device named nature

22:43.970 --> 22:46.970
The circuit of infinite synapses

22:46.970 --> 22:47.510
read

22:47.510 --> 22:48.050
write

22:48.050 --> 22:48.720
enter

22:48.720 --> 22:49.350
code

22:49.350 --> 22:52.730
Sharing tools can lead to unavoidable situations

22:52.680 --> 22:54.310
You're in a good mood today, Clarin.

22:53.440 --> 23:04.030
{talk}{this is pandoradio, it'll change each week, ignore this segemnt}

22:54.310 --> 22:56.810
My operating efficiency increases when my ears are cleaned.

22:56.810 --> 22:57.650
The reason is unknown.

22:57.650 --> 22:59.570
It's easier to work when you're in a good mood,

22:59.570 --> 23:01.150
and humming a tune makes it fun!

23:01.150 --> 23:03.030
I know! We should sing together!

23:03.030 --> 23:04.030
But I'm already singing.

23:04.030 --> 23:05.410
Saving data

23:05.410 --> 23:06.780
Strengthening predictions

23:06.780 --> 23:09.780
Even my latest updates

23:09.780 --> 23:15.080
can't help explain why you're so nice to me

23:15.080 --> 23:16.670
Error error

23:16.670 --> 23:18.170
parameter

23:18.170 --> 23:21.550
Please help me understand

23:21.550 --> 23:23.720
where these emotions came from.

23:23.720 --> 23:26.890
Find me at the end of this labrynth

23:26.890 --> 23:29.640
of feelings I can no longer control

23:29.640 --> 23:31.640
I understand the concept of emotions

23:31.640 --> 23:35.020
but I can't make any sense of my own

23:35.390 --> 23:38.020
I want to pull out these cords

23:38.360 --> 23:40.770
and head straight to you

23:40.770 --> 23:43.190
I won't come to understand love

23:43.190 --> 23:46.950
without having you here with me

23:53.200 --> 23:56.830
I'm gonna get my hands on BUER!

23:56.830 --> 23:58.170
Don't even try.

23:58.170 --> 23:59.210
Uzal!?

23:59.210 --> 24:01.710
It's too big to fit in your pocket, Takumi.

24:01.710 --> 24:03.420
Look, where are you transmitting from!?

24:03.420 --> 24:04.420
It's a recorded video.
